[{"id":"ashraka-23-59-4","words":["verb:ashraka"],"options":[{"bs":"(ne) pripisuju druga","en":"they (do not) associate partners"},{"bs":"pripisujete druga Allahu","en":"you (all) associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"i učini ga sudionikom!","en":"and make him share!"},{"bs":"pripisujem druga Allahu","en":"I associate (partners with God)"}],"ref":"23:59","answerWord":"يُشْرِكُونَ","answerSound":"audio/b7518e3149c4be6e647b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And those who ascribe not partners unto their Lord,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pripisivati druga (Allahu)","en":"to associate (partners with God)"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","هُم","بِرَبِّهِمْ","لَا","يُشْرِكُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَشْرَكَ"}},{"id":"ashraka-2-96-7","words":["verb:ashraka"],"options":[{"bs":"pripisali su druga Allahu","en":"they associated (partners with God)"},{"bs":"i učini ga sudionikom!","en":"and make him share!"},{"bs":"pripisujemo druga Allahu","en":"we associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisuje druga Allahu","en":"he/it associates (partners with God)"}],"ref":"2:96","answerWord":"أَشْرَكُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/97077632d30ffdbc5400.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And thou wilt find them greediest of mankind for life and (greedier) than the idolaters. (Each) one of them would like to be allowed to live a thousand years. And to live (a thousand years) would be no means remove him from the doom. Allah is Seer of what they do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pripisivati druga (Allahu)","en":"to associate (partners with God)"},"passage":["وَلَتَجِدَنَّهُمْ","أَحْرَصَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","عَلَىٰ","حَيَوٰةٍ","وَمِنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أَشْرَكُوا۟","يَوَدُّ","أَحَدُهُمْ","لَوْ","يُعَمَّرُ","أَلْفَ","سَنَةٍ","وَمَا","هُوَ","بِمُزَحْزِحِهِۦ","مِنَ","ٱلْعَذَابِ","أَن","يُعَمَّرَ","وَٱللَّهُ","بَصِيرٌۢ","بِمَا","يَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"أَشْرَكَ"}},{"id":"ashraka-40-73-6","words":["verb:ashraka"],"options":[{"bs":"pripisujete druga Allahu","en":"you (all) associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisuje druga Allahu","en":"he/it associates (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisali su druga Allahu","en":"they associated (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisali ste druga Allahu","en":"you (all) associated (partners with God)"}],"ref":"40:73","answerWord":"تُشْرِكُونَ","answerSound":"audio/09711aae471776b917d8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then it is said unto them: Where are (all) that ye used to make partners (in the Sovereignty)","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pripisivati druga (Allahu)","en":"to associate (partners with God)"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","قِيلَ","لَهُمْ","أَيْنَ","مَا","كُنتُمْ","تُشْرِكُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَشْرَكَ"}},{"id":"ashraka-4-48-14","words":["verb:ashraka"],"options":[{"bs":"pripisuje druga Allahu","en":"he/it associates (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisujemo druga Allahu","en":"we associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisujem druga Allahu","en":"I associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisali su druga Allahu","en":"they associated (partners with God)"}],"ref":"4:48","answerWord":"يُشْرِكْ","answerSound":"audio/dc16b382fd6770cc5e9a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! Allah forgiveth not that a partner should be ascribed unto Him. He forgiveth (all) save that to whom He will. Whoso ascribeth partners to Allah, he hath indeed invented a tremendous sin.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pripisivati druga (Allahu)","en":"to associate (partners with God)"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَا","يَغْفِرُ","أَن","يُشْرَكَ","بِهِۦ","وَيَغْفِرُ","مَا","دُونَ","ذَٰلِكَ","لِمَن","يَشَآءُ","وَمَن","يُشْرِكْ","بِٱللَّهِ","فَقَدِ","ٱفْتَرَىٰٓ","إِثْمًا","عَظِيمًا"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"أَشْرَكَ"}},{"id":"ashraka-6-22-6","words":["verb:ashraka"],"options":[{"bs":"(oni koji su) pripisivali druga","en":"(those who) associated partners"},{"bs":"pripisuje druga Allahu","en":"he/it associates (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisao je druga Allahu","en":"he/it associated (partners with God)"},{"bs":"(ne) pripisuju druga","en":"they (do not) associate partners"}],"ref":"6:22","answerWord":"أَشْرَكُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/7603b0a77de1f298182c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And on the day We gather them together We shall say unto those who ascribed partners (unto Allah): Where are (now) those partners of your make-believe?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pripisivati druga (Allahu)","en":"to associate (partners with God)"},"passage":["وَيَوْمَ","نَحْشُرُهُمْ","جَمِيعًا","ثُمَّ","نَقُولُ","لِلَّذِينَ","أَشْرَكُوٓا۟","أَيْنَ","شُرَكَآؤُكُمُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كُنتُمْ","تَزْعُمُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَشْرَكَ"}},{"id":"ashraka-72-2-6","words":["verb:ashraka"],"options":[{"bs":"pripisujemo druga Allahu","en":"we associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisali ste druga Allahu","en":"you (all) associated (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisuju druga Allahu","en":"they associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisuje druga Allahu","en":"he/it associates (partners with God)"}],"ref":"72:2","answerWord":"نُّشْرِكَ","answerSound":"audio/6866bc50881df15149da.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Which guideth unto righteousness, so we believe in it and we ascribe no partner unto our Lord.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pripisivati druga (Allahu)","en":"to associate (partners with God)"},"passage":["يَهْدِىٓ","إِلَى","ٱلرُّشْدِ","فَـَٔامَنَّا","بِهِۦ","وَلَن","نُّشْرِكَ","بِرَبِّنَآ","أَحَدًا"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَشْرَكَ"}},{"id":"ashraka-18-38-5","words":["verb:ashraka"],"options":[{"bs":"pripisujem druga Allahu","en":"I associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisao je druga Allahu","en":"he/it associated (partners with God)"},{"bs":"(ne) pripisuju druga","en":"they (do not) associate partners"},{"bs":"(oni koji su) pripisivali druga","en":"(those who) associated partners"}],"ref":"18:38","answerWord":"أُشْرِكُ","answerSound":"audio/b348231c6d74b7af032f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But He is Allah, my Lord, and I ascribe unto my Lord no partner.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pripisivati druga (Allahu)","en":"to associate (partners with God)"},"passage":["لَّٰكِنَّا۠","هُوَ","ٱللَّهُ","رَبِّى","وَلَآ","أُشْرِكُ","بِرَبِّىٓ","أَحَدًا"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَشْرَكَ"}},{"id":"ashraka-6-81-3","words":["verb:ashraka"],"options":[{"bs":"pripisali ste druga Allahu","en":"you (all) associated (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisujete druga Allahu","en":"you (all) associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisuje druga Allahu","en":"he/it associates (partners with God)"},{"bs":"(ne) pripisuju druga","en":"they (do not) associate partners"}],"ref":"6:81","answerWord":"أَشْرَكْتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/be035e06ba3051d06f95.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"How should I fear that which ye set up beside Him, when ye fear not to set up beside Allah that for which He hath revealed unto you no warrant? Which of the two factions hath more right to safety? (Answer me that) if ye have knowledge.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pripisivati druga (Allahu)","en":"to associate (partners with God)"},"passage":["وَكَيْفَ","أَخَافُ","مَآ","أَشْرَكْتُمْ","وَلَا","تَخَافُونَ","أَنَّكُمْ","أَشْرَكْتُم","بِٱللَّهِ","مَا","لَمْ","يُنَزِّلْ","بِهِۦ","عَلَيْكُمْ","سُلْطَٰنًا","فَأَىُّ","ٱلْفَرِيقَيْنِ","أَحَقُّ","بِٱلْأَمْنِ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","تَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَشْرَكَ"}},{"id":"ashraka-6-81-7","words":["verb:ashraka"],"options":[{"bs":"pripisali ste druga Allahu","en":"you (all) associated (partners with God)"},{"bs":"zar pripisuju druga Allahu?","en":"do they associate (partners with God)?"},{"bs":"pripisujemo druga Allahu","en":"we associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisuje druga Allahu","en":"he/it associates (partners with God)"}],"ref":"6:81","answerWord":"أَشْرَكْتُم","answerSound":"audio/3138a2ed1036b9b10be6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"How should I fear that which ye set up beside Him, when ye fear not to set up beside Allah that for which He hath revealed unto you no warrant? Which of the two factions hath more right to safety? (Answer me that) if ye have knowledge.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pripisivati druga (Allahu)","en":"to associate (partners with God)"},"passage":["وَكَيْفَ","أَخَافُ","مَآ","أَشْرَكْتُمْ","وَلَا","تَخَافُونَ","أَنَّكُمْ","أَشْرَكْتُم","بِٱللَّهِ","مَا","لَمْ","يُنَزِّلْ","بِهِۦ","عَلَيْكُمْ","سُلْطَٰنًا","فَأَىُّ","ٱلْفَرِيقَيْنِ","أَحَقُّ","بِٱلْأَمْنِ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","تَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"أَشْرَكَ"}},{"id":"ashraka-7-173-3","words":["verb:ashraka"],"options":[{"bs":"pripisao je druga Allahu","en":"he/it associated (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisali ste druga Allahu","en":"you (all) associated (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisujem druga Allahu","en":"I associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisuje druga Allahu","en":"he/it associates (partners with God)"}],"ref":"7:173","answerWord":"أَشْرَكَ","answerSound":"audio/c9490e64e06189a58fb7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Or lest ye should say: (It is) only (that) our fathers ascribed partners to Allah of old and we were (their) seed after them. Wilt Thou destroy us on account of that which those who follow falsehood did?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pripisivati druga (Allahu)","en":"to associate (partners with God)"},"passage":["أَوْ","تَقُولُوٓا۟","إِنَّمَآ","أَشْرَكَ","ءَابَآؤُنَا","مِن","قَبْلُ","وَكُنَّا","ذُرِّيَّةً","مِّنۢ","بَعْدِهِمْ","أَفَتُهْلِكُنَا","بِمَا","فَعَلَ","ٱلْمُبْطِلُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَشْرَكَ"}},{"id":"ashraka-7-191-0","words":["verb:ashraka"],"options":[{"bs":"zar pripisuju druga Allahu?","en":"do they associate (partners with God)?"},{"bs":"pripisuju druga Allahu","en":"they associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"i pripisujem druga Allahu","en":"and I associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisujemo druga Allahu","en":"we associate (partners with God)"}],"ref":"7:191","answerWord":"أَيُشْرِكُونَ","answerSound":"audio/db8491b2d910cdcbbe8b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Attribute they as partners to Allah those who created naught, but are themselves created,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pripisivati druga (Allahu)","en":"to associate (partners with God)"},"passage":["أَيُشْرِكُونَ","مَا","لَا","يَخْلُقُ","شَيْـًٔا","وَهُمْ","يُخْلَقُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَشْرَكَ"}},{"id":"ashraka-13-36-19","words":["verb:ashraka"],"options":[{"bs":"pripisujem druga Allahu","en":"I associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisujete druga Allahu","en":"you (all) associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisuje druga Allahu","en":"he/it associates (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisujemo druga Allahu","en":"we associate (partners with God)"}],"ref":"13:36","answerWord":"أُشْرِكَ","answerSound":"audio/4179193480eaad95a047.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those unto whom We gave the Scripture rejoice in that which is revealed unto thee. And of the clans there are who deny some of it. Say: I am commanded only that I serve Allah and ascribe unto Him no partner. Unto Him I cry, and unto Him is my return.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pripisivati druga (Allahu)","en":"to associate (partners with God)"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","ءَاتَيْنَٰهُمُ","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","يَفْرَحُونَ","بِمَآ","أُنزِلَ","إِلَيْكَ","وَمِنَ","ٱلْأَحْزَابِ","مَن","يُنكِرُ","بَعْضَهُۥ","قُلْ","إِنَّمَآ","أُمِرْتُ","أَنْ","أَعْبُدَ","ٱللَّهَ","وَلَآ","أُشْرِكَ","بِهِۦٓ","إِلَيْهِ","أَدْعُوا۟","وَإِلَيْهِ","مَـَٔابِ"],"marked":[19],"facts":{"verb":"أَشْرَكَ"}},{"id":"ashraka-18-26-19","words":["verb:ashraka"],"options":[{"bs":"pripisuje druga Allahu","en":"he/it associates (partners with God)"},{"bs":"(oni koji su) pripisivali druga","en":"(those who) associated partners"},{"bs":"i pripisujem druga Allahu","en":"and I associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisao je druga Allahu","en":"he/it associated (partners with God)"}],"ref":"18:26","answerWord":"يُشْرِكُ","answerSound":"audio/d624d050b6e80d1703e0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Allah is Best Aware how long they tarried. His is the Invisible of the heavens and the earth. How clear of sight is He and keen of hearing! They have no protecting friend beside Him, and He maketh none to share in His government.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pripisivati druga (Allahu)","en":"to associate (partners with God)"},"passage":["قُلِ","ٱللَّهُ","أَعْلَمُ","بِمَا","لَبِثُوا۟","لَهُۥ","غَيْبُ","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","أَبْصِرْ","بِهِۦ","وَأَسْمِعْ","مَا","لَهُم","مِّن","دُونِهِۦ","مِن","وَلِىٍّ","وَلَا","يُشْرِكُ","فِى","حُكْمِهِۦٓ","أَحَدًا"],"marked":[19],"facts":{"verb":"أَشْرَكَ"}},{"id":"ashraka-18-42-16","words":["verb:ashraka"],"options":[{"bs":"pripisujem druga Allahu","en":"I associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"zar pripisuju druga Allahu?","en":"do they associate (partners with God)?"},{"bs":"pripisuju druga Allahu","en":"they associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisali ste druga Allahu","en":"you (all) associated (partners with God)"}],"ref":"18:42","answerWord":"أُشْرِكْ","answerSound":"audio/035bee0939b7b5ed413e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And his fruit was beset (with destruction). Then began he to wring his hands for all that he had spent upon it, when (now) it was all ruined on its trellises, and to say: Would that I had ascribed no partner to my Lord!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pripisivati druga (Allahu)","en":"to associate (partners with God)"},"passage":["وَأُحِيطَ","بِثَمَرِهِۦ","فَأَصْبَحَ","يُقَلِّبُ","كَفَّيْهِ","عَلَىٰ","مَآ","أَنفَقَ","فِيهَا","وَهِىَ","خَاوِيَةٌ","عَلَىٰ","عُرُوشِهَا","وَيَقُولُ","يَٰلَيْتَنِى","لَمْ","أُشْرِكْ","بِرَبِّىٓ","أَحَدًا"],"marked":[16],"facts":{"verb":"أَشْرَكَ"}},{"id":"ashraka-20-32-0","words":["verb:ashraka"],"options":[{"bs":"i učini ga sudionikom!","en":"and make him share!"},{"bs":"pripisujemo druga Allahu","en":"we associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisao je druga Allahu","en":"he/it associated (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisao si druga Allahu","en":"you associated (partners with God)"}],"ref":"20:32","answerWord":"وَأَشْرِكْهُ","answerSound":"audio/46eaf2b092f7a6eb309b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And let him share my task,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pripisivati druga (Allahu)","en":"to associate (partners with God)"},"passage":["وَأَشْرِكْهُ","فِىٓ","أَمْرِى"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"أَشْرَكَ"}},{"id":"ashraka-39-65-8","words":["verb:ashraka"],"options":[{"bs":"pripisao si druga Allahu","en":"you associated (partners with God)"},{"bs":"(ne) pripisuju druga","en":"they (do not) associate partners"},{"bs":"pripisali su druga Allahu","en":"they associated (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisuje druga Allahu","en":"he/it associates (partners with God)"}],"ref":"39:65","answerWord":"أَشْرَكْتَ","answerSound":"audio/cd89d5866911785bd52d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And verily it hath been revealed unto thee as unto those before thee (saying): If thou ascribe a partner to Allah thy work will fail and thou indeed wilt be among the losers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pripisivati druga (Allahu)","en":"to associate (partners with God)"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","أُوحِىَ","إِلَيْكَ","وَإِلَى","ٱلَّذِينَ","مِن","قَبْلِكَ","لَئِنْ","أَشْرَكْتَ","لَيَحْبَطَنَّ","عَمَلُكَ","وَلَتَكُونَنَّ","مِنَ","ٱلْخَٰسِرِينَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"أَشْرَكَ"}},{"id":"ashraka-40-42-3","words":["verb:ashraka"],"options":[{"bs":"i pripisujem druga Allahu","en":"and I associate (partners with God)"},{"bs":"pripisao si druga Allahu","en":"you associated (partners with God)"},{"bs":"zar pripisuju druga Allahu?","en":"do they associate (partners with God)?"},{"bs":"pripisujemo druga Allahu","en":"we associate (partners with God)"}],"ref":"40:42","answerWord":"وَأُشْرِكَ","answerSound":"audio/278f8bc21e9dbc5525a7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Ye call me to disbelieve in Allah and ascribe unto Him as partners that whereof I have no knowledge, while I call you unto the Mighty, the Forgiver.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pripisivati druga (Allahu)","en":"to associate (partners with God)"},"passage":["تَدْعُونَنِى","لِأَكْفُرَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَأُشْرِكَ","بِهِۦ","مَا","لَيْسَ","لِى","بِهِۦ","عِلْمٌ","وَأَنَا۠","أَدْعُوكُمْ","إِلَى","ٱلْعَزِيزِ","ٱلْغَفَّٰرِ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَشْرَكَ"}},{"id":"shadda-10-88-20","words":["verb:shadda"],"options":[{"bs":"i zapečati!","en":"and harden!"},{"bs":"i učvrstili smo","en":"and We strengthened"},{"bs":"ojačat ćemo","en":"we will strengthen"},{"bs":"pa stegnite!","en":"so (you all) tighten!"}],"ref":"10:88","answerWord":"وَٱشْدُدْ","answerSound":"audio/df84ec260d4fdb83ebc5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Moses said: Our Lord! Lo! Thou hast given Pharaoh and his chiefs splendour and riches in the life of the world, Our Lord! that they may lead men astray from Thy way. Our Lord! Destroy their riches and harden their hearts so that they believe not till they see the painful doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stegnuti, ojačati","en":"to tighten, to strengthen"},"passage":["وَقَالَ","مُوسَىٰ","رَبَّنَآ","إِنَّكَ","ءَاتَيْتَ","فِرْعَوْنَ","وَمَلَأَهُۥ","زِينَةً","وَأَمْوَٰلًا","فِى","ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","رَبَّنَا","لِيُضِلُّوا۟","عَن","سَبِيلِكَ","رَبَّنَا","ٱطْمِسْ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَمْوَٰلِهِمْ","وَٱشْدُدْ","عَلَىٰ","قُلُوبِهِمْ","فَلَا","يُؤْمِنُوا۟","حَتَّىٰ","يَرَوُا۟","ٱلْعَذَابَ","ٱلْأَلِيمَ"],"marked":[20],"facts":{"verb":"شَدَّ"}},{"id":"shadda-20-31-0","words":["verb:shadda"],"options":[{"bs":"ojačaj","en":"strengthen"},{"bs":"pa stegnite!","en":"so (you all) tighten!"},{"bs":"ojačat ćemo","en":"we will strengthen"},{"bs":"i ojačali smo","en":"and we strengthened"}],"ref":"20:31","answerWord":"ٱشْدُدْ","answerSound":"audio/362dd78fd9b52497e2b2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Confirm my strength with him","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stegnuti, ojačati","en":"to tighten, to strengthen"},"passage":["ٱشْدُدْ","بِهِۦٓ","أَزْرِى"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"شَدَّ"}},{"id":"shadda-28-35-1","words":["verb:shadda"],"options":[{"bs":"ojačat ćemo","en":"we will strengthen"},{"bs":"i zapečati!","en":"and harden!"},{"bs":"i ojačali smo","en":"and we strengthened"},{"bs":"pa stegnite!","en":"so (you all) tighten!"}],"ref":"28:35","answerWord":"سَنَشُدُّ","answerSound":"audio/2145a13d5be738445336.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: We will strengthen thine arm with thy brother, and We will give unto you both power so that they cannot reach you for Our portents. Ye twain, and those who follow you, will be the winners.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stegnuti, ojačati","en":"to tighten, to strengthen"},"passage":["قَالَ","سَنَشُدُّ","عَضُدَكَ","بِأَخِيكَ","وَنَجْعَلُ","لَكُمَا","سُلْطَٰنًا","فَلَا","يَصِلُونَ","إِلَيْكُمَا","بِـَٔايَٰتِنَآ","أَنتُمَا","وَمَنِ","ٱتَّبَعَكُمَا","ٱلْغَٰلِبُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"شَدَّ"}},{"id":"shadda-38-20-0","words":["verb:shadda"],"options":[{"bs":"i učvrstili smo","en":"and We strengthened"},{"bs":"pa stegnite!","en":"so (you all) tighten!"},{"bs":"ojačat ćemo","en":"we will strengthen"},{"bs":"i zapečati!","en":"and harden!"}],"ref":"38:20","answerWord":"وَشَدَدْنَا","answerSound":"audio/89f4a735ace9a2ef9598.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"We made his kingdom strong and gave him wisdom and decisive speech.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stegnuti, ojačati","en":"to tighten, to strengthen"},"passage":["وَشَدَدْنَا","مُلْكَهُۥ","وَءَاتَيْنَٰهُ","ٱلْحِكْمَةَ","وَفَصْلَ","ٱلْخِطَابِ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"شَدَّ"}},{"id":"shadda-76-28-2","words":["verb:shadda"],"options":[{"bs":"i ojačali smo","en":"and we strengthened"},{"bs":"ojačat ćemo","en":"we will strengthen"},{"bs":"i zapečati!","en":"and harden!"},{"bs":"pa stegnite!","en":"so (you all) tighten!"}],"ref":"76:28","answerWord":"وَشَدَدْنَآ","answerSound":"audio/9217f1d7ec9d5f4b041c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"We, even We, created them, and strengthened their frame. And when We will, We can replace them, bringing others like them in their stead.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"stegnuti, ojačati","en":"to tighten, to strengthen"},"passage":["نَّحْنُ","خَلَقْنَٰهُمْ","وَشَدَدْنَآ","أَسْرَهُمْ","وَإِذَا","شِئْنَا","بَدَّلْنَآ","أَمْثَٰلَهُمْ","تَبْدِيلًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"شَدَّ"}}]